{"index": 3, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<h2>第三轮逐步修正图档</h2><p>下面按版本与步骤保存首稿和中间稿。与最终候选完全相同的修正版不重复插图，已在上文展示；每一次生成和编辑的完整提示词、参考路径、原因、效果与不足都保存在本节附件中。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 140, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
{"index": 4, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<p>10初稿：黏土脸通过，饰品误成蝴蝶；随后只换成桐叶。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 141, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
