{"index": 6, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<p>11初稿：月牙眼通过，但比例偏短且叶饰不明确；随后修正全身比例及桐叶。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 144, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
